{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The Artifactory \u2013 A Chaotic Fantasy Lootbox Factory!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511520/extras/wishlistnow.gif?t=1743531428\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511520/extras/Group_66__1_.png?t=1743531428\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to <strong>The Artifactory</strong>, the world\u2019s most <i>questionably managed</i> lootbox factory! Your job? Fulfill magical item orders by crafting, forging, and enchanting loot\u2014without knowing exactly what customers want. Just follow the vague instructions (\u201cwe need <i>some</i> rare stuff!\u201d) and hope for the best!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511520/extras/Movie_037-1_1.gif?t=1743531428\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Of course, nothing in this enchanted workplace runs smoothly. Conveyor belts jam, machines break down, and lava (yes, actual lava) tends to get in the way. Work solo or with up to <strong>4 players in couch co-op</strong> as you race against time, chaos, and your own questionable teamwork skills!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511520/extras/Group_67__1_.png?t=1743531428\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Take Lootbox Orders!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customers only specify <strong>how many items</strong> they want and their <strong>rarity level</strong>\u2014it\u2019s up to you to decide what to make!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511520/extras/rarity-levels.png?t=1743531428\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Four item rarities</strong> determine your payout and crafting complexity:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u26aa\u00a0<strong>Common</strong> \u2013 Quick and easy, like basic potions or slightly sharpened sticks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd35\u00a0<strong>Rare</strong> \u2013 Stronger, shinier, and a little trickier to craft.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udfe3\u00a0<strong>Epic</strong> \u2013 Takes skill, patience, and possibly a little luck.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udfe0\u00a0<strong>Legendary</strong> \u2013 Wildly powerful, insanely valuable, and an absolute nightmare to produce.</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511520/extras/resources.gif?t=1743531428\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Grab Ingredients From the Conveyor Belts!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Supplies <strong>arrive at random</strong> on conveyor belts. Grab what you need before it rolls away\u2014or worse, falls into a pit of doom.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If the belts stop working, <i>you</i> stop working. Keep them running, or prepare for chaos!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511520/extras/workbenches.png?t=1743531428\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Craft, Forge &amp; Enchant!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Cauldrons:</strong> Brew magical potions (or explode things by accident).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Anvils:</strong> Smith powerful weapons\u2014unless you let the forge go cold.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Altars:</strong> Infuse items with enchantments\u2026 if you don\u2019t miscast a spell and turn them into socks.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Pack the Loot &amp; Get Paid!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Load everything into lootboxes, seal them, and send them off!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Better loot means <strong>more gold and stars</strong>, unlocking <strong>new recipes, characters, and challenges</strong>.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511520/extras/Group_68__1_.png?t=1743531428\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Lava. Just\u2026 lava.</strong> Watch your step, or your lootbox might end up <i>crispy</i>.<br><strong>Floating platforms.</strong> Some workstations <i>move</i> (usually at the worst time).<br><strong>Broken machines.</strong> If it breaks, <i>you</i> fix it\u2014or suffer the consequences.<br><strong>Puzzle madness.</strong> Sometimes, getting to the delivery truck is a challenge in itself.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Why You\u2019ll Love It</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2705 <strong>Co-op Chaos:</strong> Play <strong>solo or with up to 4 players</strong> for maximum mayhem.<br>\u2705 <strong>Endless Experimentation:</strong> Discover <strong>new recipes and unexpected item combos</strong>.<br>\u2705 <strong>Unlockables Galore:</strong> Find new characters, blueprints, and more as you progress.<br>\u2705 <strong>Unpredictable Fun:</strong> Every level throws new obstacles, disasters, and challenges your way.<br>\u2705 <strong>Hilarious Moments:</strong> If you\u2019ve ever wanted to bonk your friend on the head with any item you pick up while trying to pack a lootbox, this is your game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can you keep the <strong>world\u2019s most ridiculous factory</strong> running smoothly? (Spoiler: No. But you\u2019ll have a blast trying.)</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3511520?t=1743531428","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511520/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743531428","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511520/b5385fdac7a01be8cc2aca51b4ed64e06c0cd3a8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743531428","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511520/b5385fdac7a01be8cc2aca51b4ed64e06c0cd3a8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743531428","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The Artifactory \u2013 A Chaotic Fantasy Lootbox Factory!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511520/extras/wishlistnow.gif?t=1743531428\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511520/extras/Group_66__1_.png?t=1743531428\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to <strong>The Artifactory</strong>, the world\u2019s most <i>questionably managed</i> lootbox factory! Your job? Fulfill magical item orders by crafting, forging, and enchanting loot\u2014without knowing exactly what customers want. Just follow the vague instructions (\u201cwe need <i>some</i> rare stuff!\u201d) and hope for the best!</p><p cla