store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511520/extras/resources.gif?t=1743531428\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Grab Ingredients From the Conveyor Belts!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Supplies <strong>arrive at random</strong> on conveyor belts. Grab what you need before it rolls away\u2014or worse, falls into a pit of doom.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If the belts stop working, <i>you</i> stop working. Keep them running, or prepare for chaos!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511520/extras/workbenches.png?t=1743531428\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Craft, Forge &amp; Enchant!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Cauldrons:</strong> Brew magical potions (or explode things by accident).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Anvils:</strong> Smith powerful weapons\u2014unless you let the forge go cold.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Altars:</strong> Infuse items with enchantments\u2026 if you don\u2019t miscast a spell and turn them into socks.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Pack the Loot &amp; Get Paid!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Load everything into lootboxes, seal them, and send them off!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Better loot means <strong>more gold and stars</strong>, unlocking <strong>new recipes, characters, and challenges</strong>.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511520/extras/Group_68__1_.png?t=1743531428\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Lava. Just\u2026 lava.</strong> Watch your step, or your lootbox might end up <i>crispy</i>.<br><strong>Floating platforms.</strong> Some workstations <i>move</i> (usually at the worst time).<br><strong>Broken machines.</strong> If it breaks, <i>you</i> fix it\u2014or suffer the consequences.<br><strong>Puzzle madness.</strong> Sometimes, getting to the delivery truck is a challenge in itself.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Why You\u2019ll Love It</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2705 <strong>Co-op Chaos:</strong> Play <strong>solo or with up to 4 players</strong> for maximum mayhem.<br>\u2705 <strong>Endless Experimentation:</strong> Discover <strong>new recipes and unexpected item combos</strong>.<br>\u2705 <strong>Unlockables Galore:</strong> Find new characters, blueprints, and more as you progress.<br>\u2705 <strong>Unpredictable Fun:</strong> Every level throws new obstacles, disasters, and challenges your way.<br>\u2705 <strong>Hilarious Moments:</strong> If you\u2019ve ever wanted to bonk your friend on the head with any item you pick up while trying to pack a lootbox, this is your game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can you keep the <strong>world\u2019s most ridiculous factory</strong> running smoothly? (Spoiler: No. But you\u2019ll have a blast trying.)</p>","developers":["Berries Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511520/e196566474a91ceadd158d1b8327c200355aa42f/header.jpg?t=1743531428","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257100321,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257100321/movie480.mp4?t=1743488174","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257100321/movie_max.mp4?t=1743488174"},"name":"The Artifactory \u2013 Official Announcement Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257100321/cb7aea729c01f01a07c08c73ed6bcd62ea168e7f/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1743488174","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257100321/movie480_vp9.